invariant: INV-16
file: widemul.h
catches: test/chacha-builds.sh
reason: widemul_poly1305_ifma reads the multiply bit alone, so every session
  with it runs the AVX-512 IFMA Poly1305 and dies of SIGILL on a CPU without
  AVX-512 IFMA. Every vector passes on a CPU with it, because the kernel
  computes the same accumulator. The script compiles aead.c for x86-64 and
  requires its MAC to call poly1305_update_avx2_native, the update a
  session with the multiply bit and CH_CPU_AVX2 alone runs.

--- old
    return widemul_native(widemul) && (cpu & CH_CPU_AVX512_IFMA) != 0;
--- new
    (void)cpu;
    return widemul_native(widemul);
